elle (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  ELLE v1.0.0 - First Stable Release

  This is the initial stable release of ELLE, the Enabling Layer Learning
  Everything system assistant for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS.

  Key features:
  * Intent classification with local Ollama inference
  * Man Vault documentation search (SQLite+FTS5)
  * Incident Vault decision memory
  * Reactive Functions for event-driven automation
  * Policy engine for safe command execution
  * Capability auto-generation from installed packages

  Configuration:
  * Main config: /etc/elle/elle.toml
  * State databases: /var/lib/elle/
  * Logs: journalctl -u elled

 -- Tyler Araujo <araujota97@gmail.com>  Mon, 27 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
